<title>USA: HoloPak sees difficult Q4.</title>
<headline>HoloPak sees difficult Q4.</headline>
<dateline>EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HoloPak Technologies Inc said on Tuesday that the company's operating environment will be difficult in the fourth quarter ending March 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect the operating environment to remain difficult for the final quarter of the year, particularly in metallized paper,&quot; president and chief executive officer Robert Coghan said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;However, we expect that the overall environment for hot-stamping and holographic products will begin to improve,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>In last year's fourth quarter, HoloPak reported a loss of $0.02 a share on revenues of $10.7 million.</p>
